WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.377
Before finishing, check whether you can trace control flow without running the code.

00:00:05.377 --> 00:00:08.812
Can you tell when a condition is true or false?

00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:13.182
Can you identify the indented block controlled by an if statement?

00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:16.749
Can you follow one repetition of a loop at a time?

00:00:17.386 --> 00:00:25.403
For while loops, make sure you can point to the value that changes and eventually stops the loop.

00:00:25.403 --> 00:00:31.638
For analytics, make sure you can recognize the classify, count, flag, and summarize patterns.
